# Chip drums on the arp track: a noise kick (long noise, sweep down 30 oct/s, short decay), a metallic snare and
# noise hats at three pitches, velocity steps in the 4-bit volume.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 1.0
track arp
preset 192 236 0 20 0 20 0 0 128 0 128 210 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C3 1 127
param p1 224 2
param p2 0 2
note 2 D4 1 110
param p1 192 3
note 3 C7 1 60
note 4 C3 1 127
param p1 224 5
note 6 D4 1 127
param p1 192 7
note 7 G7 1 90
note 8 C3 1 127
note 10 C8 1 40
note 11 C7 1 20
note 12 C3 1 127
note 14 D4 1 127
note 15 C7 1 1
expect sound 0 15
expect idle 24
expect peak_below -9       # noise peaks at -15 dBFS; two voices overlap
